OL,3,AReports of violence against women in
OL,4,AGaza surge, UN agency finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a sharp rise in reports
OL,7,Fof violence against women and girls in
OL,8,Fthe Gaza Strip, including early and
OL,9,Fforced marriage, according to a series
OL,10,Fof recent reports from the UN
OL,11,FPopulation Fund (UNFPA).
OL,13,FOne report, which analyses data
OL,14,Fcollected by 10 organisations, says the
OL,15,Fprotracted crisis in war-torn Gaza has
OL,16,F"created conditions in which women and
OL,17,Fgirls face escalating risks of
OL,18,Fgender-based violence".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
