OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AReports of violence against women in
OL,4,AGaza surge, UN agency finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also warns that there has been a
OL,7,F"severe escalation" in the number of
OL,8,Fearly and forced marriage incidents in
OL,9,Fthe second quarter of this year. Both
OL,10,Fare considered types of gender-based
OL,11,Fviolence (GBV) by the UN.
OL,13,FAnother report presenting testimony
OL,14,Ffrom 230 women in crowded displacement
OL,15,Fcamps in Gaza City and Khan Younis
OL,16,Fmakes for a grim read, describing the
OL,17,Fviolence they have experienced or
OL,18,Fwitnessed.
